==Czech==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|cs|zlw-ocs|sěděti}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*sěděti}}, from {{inh|cs|ine-bsl-pro|*sēdḗˀtei}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*sedéh₁yeti}}, from {{inh|cs|ine-pro|*sed-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-sedět.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|se|dět}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=impf|pf=posedět}}

# to [[sit]] {{gloss|to be in a sitting position}}
# to [[fit]] {{gloss|of clothing}}
#: {{syn|cs|padnout}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Ty šaty ti '''nesedí'''.|That dress doesn't fit you.}}

====Usage notes====
'''Sedět''' is in the class of Czech [[stative verb]]s. Its counterpart, {{l|cs|sedat}}, is a [[dynamic verb]].

